@sheet Data [json]
[
  { "sku": "A1", "stock": 5, "reserved": 2 },
  { "sku": "B2", "stock": 8, "reserved": 1 }
]

@sheet Summary
-Metric-Value-
| Stock | =SUM(Data!stock) |
| Reserved | =SUM(Data!reserved) |
| Available | =B2-B3 |

@sheet Orders
-Metric-Value-
| Double available | =Summary!B4*2 |
| Copy stock | =Summary!B2 |
